:: Ordson Medical
<<set $player.location="Ordson Medical">>\
Adventurers often rely on health potions and magic in the field. In a big city like Ordson, however, you can seek treatment at a hospital. Ordson Medical provides exactly that.

You walk into the lobby and approach the front desk.

[[See A Doctor|Doctor]]

[[Leave|Upper District]]

:: Ordson Medical Recovery
<<set $player.location="Ordson Medical">>\
You wake in a bed at Ordson Medical several hours later. Someone must have found you unconscious and brought you back to the city. The hospital staff have already treated your injuries, though your body still aches from the fight.

[[Get out of bed|Ordson Medical]]

:: Doctor
You're brought to a private room where a doctor comes in to see you.

<<if $player.health < $player.maxHealth>>\
    <<set $player.health = $player.maxHealth>>\
    "You look hurt. Let me patch you right up," the doctor says. "There we go. You should feel much better!"
<</if>>\
The doctor decides that you don't need any further treatment and quickly dismisses you.

[[Leave|Upper District]]
